From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Maxim Stepanov <g.maxim.stepanoff@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 22 Jul 2026 22:55:54 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] database_client: wire the extracted crate into the v1.11.3
 workspace

The database_client crate lives in the parent repo (zedium/crates/database_client);
join it to the zed workspace via an in-tree symlink (crates/database_client ->
../../crates/database_client) since an out-of-root member can't resolve
workspace.package inheritance.

Wiring:
- Cargo: workspace member + dep (path = crates/database_client), zed dep,
  tokio-postgres / tokio-postgres-rustls workspace deps.
- settings_content: add `database` field + DatabaseSettingsContent /
  Database{Sidebar,Toolbar}SettingsContent (reconstructed from patches
  0126/0148/0179/0212/0226). vscode_import: database: None.
- icons: add Calendar/Database/Fingerprint/Key/Table/ToggleLeft variants + SVGs.
- init: database_client::init(cx) in main.rs (prod) + zed.rs (test).

v1.11.3 crate API drift fixed: PickerDelegate::name (object_search,
query_history); highlight_rows now takes fn(&App) -> Hsla (query_view).

cargo check --workspace: 0 errors. just verify: pass.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
